# Private research workspace; never commit raw sources or notes.
# Also the telemetry-fixture capture staging (`scratch/telemetry-fixtures/`):
# unscrubbed/under-review captures live here until they pass manual review and are
# promoted to the corpus — see docs/how/telemetry-fixtures.md (plan 037).
scratch/

# Local agent tool state (activity logs, etc.)
.chainglass/

# FlowSpace MCP local index
.fs2/

# minih agent runtime artifacts (per-run logs/events/state)
agents/*/runs/
.minih/

# flow-pair run ledger (per-run prompts/diffs/ledger — local orchestration state)
.flow-pair/

# Harness scratch buffer — crash-resilient agent working notes (.harness/ itself is committed;
# only the temp/ scratch dir is ignored — records under .harness/records/ stay tracked).
.harness/temp/

# Skills-install OUTPUT (plan 055) — install STATE on a consumer/dev machine, never
# source. Source skills live in `skills/`; these are produced by `harness skills install`
# (which shells `npx skills add`) and must never be accidentally committed:
#   - .harness/skills.lock.json — harness-owned per-project install lock (targets + scope)
#   - /skills-lock.json          — the vercel `skills` tool's own lockfile (written at cwd)
#   - .claude/skills/            — installed skill copies (project-local `-a claude-code`)
# NOTE: already-tracked skills under .claude/skills/ (e.g. flow-eval-run, committed on
# purpose) stay tracked — gitignore never untracks; this only stops NEW installed copies.
# Add a genuinely-new committed skill there with `git add -f` if ever needed.
.harness/skills.lock.json
/skills-lock.json
.claude/skills/
.agents/

# flow-eval (plan 041) run tree — COMMITTED since 2026-07-03: the append-only
# ledger.jsonl is the longitudinal record `--compare` groups on, and the per-run
# report.{json,md} are its evidence — cross-batch comparison needs them durable
# across machines/clones, not machine-local. (Was gitignored as "ephemeral"
# pre-046; the ledger design superseded that.)

# validate-harness-flow runtime manifest (non-portable abs paths + PIDs; --collect reads it locally,
# it is not durable AC-8 evidence). The copied reports/records/ROLLUP.md stay tracked.
docs/plans/*/runs/**/.last-fire.json
docs/plans/*/runs/.last-fire.json

# minih harvests validate-harness-flow worker farewells to this legacy location at runtime;
# the canonical record is relocated to .harness/records/retro/ (plan-012). Ignore only this file.
docs/retros/validate-harness-flow.md

# The review verb writes a computed `git diff` snapshot beside the review file as scratch —
# it is large, regenerable (`git diff <base>..HEAD`), and immediately stale. The durable
# artifact is review.*.md (tracked); the computed diff is not. Ignore it anywhere it lands
# (Simple-Mode `*/reviews/` and Full-Mode `tasks/*/reviews/` both).
_computed.diff
